## User question:
"During a recent core network upgrade, we need to ensure our Nokia 7750 SR routers only process BGP routes carrying the specific route target 65001:12345—both for incoming route acceptance and outbound advertisements. What’s the most efficient way to implement this selective route filtering, perhaps using route policies or community-based match conditions, without disrupting existing VPN services?"
