## Proposed answer:
configure policy-options community "RT_65001_12345" members "target:65001:12345"
configure policy-options policy-statement "FILTER_RT_65001_12345" entry 10 from community "RT_65001_12345" action accept
configure policy-options policy-statement "FILTER_RT_65001_12345" default-action reject
